<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by Mr. Torey Malatia, who I just ran into in the hallway. It was weird. He said--

00:58:44.470 --> 00:58:47.860
<v Joe>Oh, no. I can't believe you're here today.

00:58:47.860 --> 00:58:58.020
